WHAT IS PROVED (unconditional, no `sorry`/`admit`/`axiom`/stand-ins):
* Tier 1 `Gamma_one_add_im_normSq`: `‖Γ(1+iy)‖² = πy/sinh(πy)` for `y ≠ 0`.
